      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Profit funnel — where are trades lost?\nRead the funnel top-to-bottom over the selected time range and use the rates to localise the bottleneck:\n\n- **Detected high, Sim-passed low** → economics/edge problem (thresholds too high, thin spreads, bad quotes). *Edge-limited.*\n- **Sim-passed high, Confirmed low** (low inclusion %, high relay-reject %) → losing the block race / relay market. *RPC/latency-limited.*\n- **All stages high, Net profit low** → spreads too thin after real gas + flash fees, or trade size capped. *Capital/edge-limited.*\n- **RPC errors climbing** → provider throttling; nothing downstream can work. *RPC-limited.*\n\nTarget: **$833 net/day** ($25k/mo). The *Projected $/day* stat extrapolates the current rate.\n\n> Note: `net_profit_*` are cumulative process gauges (reset on restart); `increase()`/`rate()` approximate per-run deltas. Realised-vs-simulated net is not yet instrumented (needs on-chain profit extraction from the executor receipt).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "valueMode": "text"
      },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "sum(increase(opportunities_detected[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "1 Detected", "refId": "A" },
        { "expr": "sum(increase(opportunities_seen_total[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "2 Seen (ranked)", "refId": "B" },
        { "expr": "sum(increase(simulations_passed_total[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "3 Sim-passed", "refId": "C" },
        { "expr": "sum(increase(tx_sent_total[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "4 Broadcast", "refId": "D" },
        { "expr": "sum(increase(tx_confirmed_total[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "5 Included", "refId": "E" },
        { "expr": "sum(increase(opportunities_executed[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "6 Executed (net+)", "refId": "F" }
      ],
      "title": "Funnel (count over range)",
      "type": "bargauge"
    },
